Drop audio files here, then run: python3 tools/sync_audio.py

Anything in this folder plays through the page's own <audio> element, which keeps
running when the phone is locked or the browser is backgrounded. Tracks without a
file here stream from YouTube instead and stop as soon as the screen goes off.

Name files after the songs in assets/data/tracks.js ("Teri Mitti.m4a") and they
attach to those entries and inherit their credits. Anything unrecognised is still
added as its own track.

Formats: .m4a, .mp3, .aac, .ogg, .opus, .webm, .flac, .wav
